  "bodyHash": "3112cf898c77d104",
  "content": "<h1>补充补丁</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplemental-patches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" style=\"padding-left:5px\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplemental-patches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" style=\"padding-left:5px\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jedlimlx/supplemental-patches/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/documentation/issues_vector.svg\" alt=\"Issue Tracker\" style=\"padding-left:5px\"></a>\n</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://supplemental-patches.pages.dev/assets/banner.png\">\n<br>\nSupplemental Patches 允许用户通过资源包为模组方块、实体、物品、粒子等创建自定义着色器。该模组默认附带一个内置资源包，支持许多流行的模组。</p>\n<p>如果已安装 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Euphoria Patches</a>，这些额外的着色器将被修补到其中。</p>\n<h2>功能</h2>\n<p>该模组一些最令人<em>兴奋</em>的功能包括（针对玩家）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>超过 500 个高质量着色器，用于来自各种流行模组的自定义材质（例如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjadens-nether-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jaden's Nether Expansion</a>）。完整列表请见<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsupplemental-patches.pages.dev%252fmod_list\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</li>\n<li>基于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenderscape\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderscape</a> 末地氛围的自定义末地星云天空盒</li>\n<li>基于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdoom-gloom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Doom and Gloom</a> 效果的酷炫雾气效果</li>\n<li>修复了许多模组的着色器问题（例如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fendergetic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Endergetic Expansion</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fupgrade-aquatic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgrade Aquatic</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdoom-gloom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Doom and Gloom</a>）</li>\n<li>修复了物品着色器在方块实体上显示时的渲染问题（例如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a> 的展示台和物品架）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有关可以修补到 Euphoria Patches 上的支持区域的详细信息，请查看此<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsupplemental-patches.pages.dev%252ftutorials%252fgetting_started\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">教程</a>。</p>\n<h2>常见问题</h2>\n<p><strong>问：</strong>会有移植到其他加载器（除 (Neo)Forge 和 Fabric 外）的版本吗？<br>\n<strong>答：</strong>可能不会。</p>\n<p><strong>问：</strong>会有向后移植的版本吗？<br>\n<strong>答：</strong>可能不会。</p>\n<p><strong>问：</strong>你能支持 XXX 模组吗？<br>\n<strong>答：</strong>一切都会按部就班地安排。或者，你也可以自己动手。有关更多详细信息，请查看此<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsupplemental-patches.pages.dev%252ftutorials%252fgetting_started\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">教程</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>问：</strong>我发现了一个 Bug。<br>\n<strong>答：</strong>请先向我报告，不要打扰 Complementary Shaders / Euphoria Patches 的开发人员。</p>\n<p><strong>问：</strong>我添加的着色器没有显示。<br>\n<strong>答：</strong>在确保资源包已加载后，尝试重新加载着色器包。或者，使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252feuphoria-companion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Euphoria Companion</a> 模组检查该方块正在哪个图层中渲染。某些方块（例如某些玻璃方块）可能会作为剪切面而不是半透明方块进行渲染。你需要使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsupplemental-patches.pages.dev%252fdocumentation%252fproperties.json\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">block.properties.json</a> 更改它们渲染所在的图层。</p>\n<p><strong>问：</strong>内置着色器无法工作。<br>\n<strong>答：</strong>类似地，尝试重新加载着色器包并确保内置资源包已加载。</p>\n<p><strong>问：</strong>这与 Optifine 兼容吗？<br>\n<strong>答：</strong>不。它仅适用于 Oculus / Iris。</p>\n<p><strong>问：</strong>我可以将其包含在我的整合包中吗？<br>\n<strong>答：</strong>可以，随意使用。</p>",
